 noon (Irish Local Time) on Friday, 9th October 2026. No late applications will be accepted. UNIVERSITY COLLEGE CORK IS AN EQUAL OPPORTUNITIES EMPLOYER Please note that an appointment to posts advertised will be dependent on University approval, together with the terms of the employment control framework for the higher education sector. Contact Person : Professor Eleanor Bantry White Contact Email : e.bantrywhite@ucc.ie Job ID : 099673 Contact Number : Close Date : 09-Oct-2026 12:00 "
